# --- SUBMISSION EXCEPTION -------------------------------------------------------------
# The organisers' notebook does sorted(glob("checkpoints/*.pth"))[-1] and asserts if it is
# empty, so the submission branch must ship EXACTLY ONE checkpoint. Everything else under
# checkpoints/ stays ignored, including checkpoints/aux/ and checkpoints/smokes/.
!checkpoints/
checkpoints/*
!checkpoints/rt_d_deepsets_aug_meanpt_encoder_20260903_214738.pth
